  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.gnu.org%252flicenses%252fgpl-3.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-GPLv3-blue.svg\" alt=\"许可证：GPL v3\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/XxInvictus/Meka-PMMO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/github-repo-blue?logo=github&link=https://github.com/XxInvictus/Meka-PMMO\" alt=\"GitHub 仓库\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/XxInvictus/Meka-PMMO/actions/workflows/dev-build.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxInvictus/Meka-PMMO/actions/workflows/dev-build.yml/badge.svg?branch=1.20.1-dev\" alt=\"开发构建与测试\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/XxInvictus/Meka-PMMO/actions/workflows/release.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxInvictus/Meka-PMMO/actions/workflows/release.yml/badge.svg\" alt=\"发布构建与发布\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/meka-pmmo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Get on Curseforge-link-chocolate?logo=curseforge&link=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/meka-pmmo\" alt=\"前往 Curseforge 获取\"></a>\n <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmeka-pmmo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Get on Modrinth-link-forestgreen?logo=modrinth&link=https://modrinth.com/mod/meka-pmmo\" alt=\"前往 Modrinth 获取\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>Meka-PMMO</h1>\n<p>Meka-PMMO 是 Mekanism 与 Project MMO (PMMO) 之间的兼容性桥梁，允许从 Mekanism 机器中获取经验值奖励。</p>\n<h2>概述</h2>\n<p>Meka-PMMO 实现了 Mekanism 的机器与 PMMO 技能系统之间的无缝集成。现在玩家在使用 Mekanism 的充能熔炉时可以获得经验值，就像使用原版熔炉一样。最新更新还增加了方块破坏经验值以及数字采矿机的限制执行功能！</p>\n<h2>依赖项</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模组</th>\n<th>版本</th>\n<th>必需</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Minecraft</td>\n<td>1.20.1</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Forge</td>\n<td>47.4.0+</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mekanism</td>\n<td>10.4.16.80+</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PMMO</td>\n<td>1.20.1-1.7.39+</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2>⚠️ 警告</h2>\n<p><em>本模组主要适用于中前期的 Mekanism。一旦进入后期，当您拥有包含多个熔炉的大型工厂，且每个熔炉都叠加了多个加速效果时，由于每次冶炼都会触发事件，这可能会导致性能问题。我未来可能会考虑引入某种缓存机制，但在此之前，请留意此警告！</em><br>\n<em>通常认为，到了游戏后期您可能不再那么需要经验值，因此可以在世界中期安全地移除该模组。</em></p>",
